{"title":"My Wife Is The Demonic Cult Leader","synopsis":"Aku menjadi putra pertama klan Demonic Heaven—salah satu dari Enam Klan Besar Kultus Heavenly Demonic—Jin Yeomyung.\n\nAku siap menikmati hidup manisku yang serba ada, tetapi gara-gara Aliansi Murim yang terkutuk itu, Kultus Heavenly Demonic hancur.\n\nTetapi di saat-saat terakhirku, Ketua Kultus Cheon Yura menoleh padaku dan berkata...\n\n“Apa kamu mau merayuku?”","alternative_title":"마교 교주의 부군이 되었다","author":"Jurey, Seong Dae Ho","artist":"Seong Dae Ho","genres":["Action","Fantasy","Martial Arts"],"chapters":[{"id":"faaeb541-2760-4c3f-8527-59ec8114d8c1","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"id":"25002bbb-c089-4d07-a71b-479ba8b2947c","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"8c635300-4a8a-4059-8e0d-83e0bda90606","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"83bd51bf-4774-424c-95c6-7a087b2c076d","number":"62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"5f993627-0969-434d-b6eb-74d85c1c646e","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"3567dabf-a5c3-48b8-b2ce-f6cc133e8231","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"30cc7633-6f19-4359-92b4-25d7b220041c","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-07-16","images":[]},{"id":"2ca6c73d-0985-4dca-948d-1c81378b5b82","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-05-14","images":[]},{"id":"978822bc-4648-4024-aded-468d64c236ad","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-05-14","images":[]},{"id":"ff69946b-0d87-4379-90db-bac16a2342bf","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-05-13","images":[]},{"id":"aec6db41-5105-441f-8e27-886db9bddf35","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-05-13","images":[]},{"id":"506dc3d9-acad-4231-9a7b-273f8b927c93","number":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-05-12","images":[]},{"id":"5e3e3324-8e23-4844-a655-aad88a054313","number":"53","title":"C